    },
    "“双屏摆放”只在 iPhone Duo 内屏、iPad 等宽屏幕上起作用。自动 = 铰链半开立起来时：横放左右分屏（左半屏朝向对方，右半屏朝向你），竖放上下分屏并让开折叠处；也可以固定成一种。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Dual-screen layout” only applies on wide screens such as the iPhone Duo inner display or iPad. Automatic = when the hinge is half open and standing: side by side in landscape (left half faces your partner, right half faces you), top and bottom in portrait with the fold kept clear. You can also fix one layout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
